  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The operations consist of the use of 55 Tudor Drive Morden SM4 4PN as a small House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) under C4 Use Class, in that the residential unit is used by three to six unrelated people. The development constitutes permitted development within the meaning of Class L, of Part 3 of Schedule 2 to the Town & Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) \"the Order\" and would comply with the development tolerances set out in said Class L, of Part 3 of Schedule 2 to the Town & Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) \"the Order\" ",
    "Condition : 2 - INFORMATIVE:\n\r\nThe applicant is reminded that the certificate applies to the use of the property for as a small HMO. Should the occupancy exceed 6 persons (Sui Generis), planning permission will be required."
